doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24339830
title: "GPRadar-UI: web interface for GPR hyperbola detection"
abstract: >-
  Static Vite + React + TypeScript web interface for GPRadar. Uploads a GPR B-scan or gprMax output to GPRadar-API and shows the radargram with detection boxes, a detections table and CSV/PNG export.
